y to describe the bushwacker is  think of the adult  frosty from wendy's but it's all kinds  of goodness has been added to it  lots of madness lots of rum cream to  cocoa  coffee liqueur some vanilla and milk and  then some 151 to top it off  bushwackers are our staple people come  from all over for the bushwacker  so good let me see set it down which way  right there on the bottom  people are coming back though many never  left  take out was a strong business for them  during lockdown  no matter how bad things were in our  past we're always going to inch forward  and you know at least is still moving  forward and moving onward and upward  and i learned something i never seen a  pork butt before  nice job with the butt thank you you did  a great job really well good  and then there's this little puppy right  here the bushwhacker  swacker i want to thank jess marcy  sue whoever brought this to the table  because this comes out of a machine at  least so take a sip everybody take a sip  [Music]  and you know what whoa i mean it's got  some action in there  that packs a punch well thank you and i  will fill in any time  just keep them come back for bushwackers  anytime elaine yes i'll be here  all right thank you michelle

